---
title: Chocolate Pillows
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Cookies
cook time: 12-15 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@flour{2.5%cups}
@butter{1%cup}
@egg, unbeaten{1}
@milk chocolate bars{10}
@salt{0.5%tsp}
@sugar{0.75%cup}
@vanilla{2%tsp}

Cream the butter and sugar. Blend in the egg and vanilla. Beat well. Stir in dry ingredients. Press dough through a cookie press, using a saw-toothed plate, into strips onto an ungreased cookie sheets. Break the candy bars into 1-inch pieces. Place on strips of dough. Press another strip of dough over the candy, covering completely. Bake at 375 degrees for 12-15 minutes until golden brown.
